    <!-- Display order groups the families by symmetry: the three Penrose
         systems, the other 5-fold tilings, then ascending fold order, with
         the pinwheel (infinitely many orientations), the Chair, then explicit
         spiral constructions. Each
         <item> here is paired by index with family_values, which carries the
         Family enum index the C++ side expects — so the menu can be reordered
         freely without disturbing stored preferences or the enum. -->
